{"after":{"hasSentPipedInput":false,"statusMessage":"Running tools...","tokenUsage":{"maxAvailable":168000,"used":18734},"type":"confirming","updateState":"none"},"before":{"hasSentPipedInput":false,"statusMessage":"Running tools...","tokenUsage":{"maxAvailable":168000,"used":18734},"type":"confirming","updateState":"none"},"event":{"blocks":[{"data":[9,{"content":[{"id":"toolu_vrtx_01C31tKiwKwxz7LujTreLv51","input":{"path":"AGENT.md"},"inputIncomplete":{"content":"# AGENT.md - Development Guide for Flare vTPM Attestation\n\n## Build/Test Commands\n- **Build contracts**: `forge build`\n- **Run all tests**: `forge test -vv` (verbose output)\n- **Run single test**: `forge test --match-test [TEST_NAME] -vv`\n- **Run specific test file**: `forge test test/FlareVtpmAttestation.t.sol -vv`\n- **Format code**: `forge fmt`\n- **Gas report**: `forge test --gas-report`\n- **Deploy","path":"AGENT.md"},"inputPartialJSON":{"json":"{\"path\": \"AGENT.md\", \"content\": \"# AGENT.md - Development Guide for Flare vTPM Attestation\\n\\n## Build/Test Commands\\n- **Build contracts**: `forge build`\\n- **Run all tests**: `forge test -vv` (verbose output)\\n- **Run single test**: `forge test --match-test [TEST_NAME] -vv`\\n- **Run specific test file**: `forge test test/FlareVtpmAttestation.t.sol -vv`\\n- **Format code**: `forge fmt`\\n- **Gas report**: `forge test --gas-report`\\n- **Deploy"},"name":"create_file","type":"tool_use"}],"role":"assistant","state":{"type":"streaming"}}],"type":"message"}],"type":"messages"},"level":"debug","message":"Transition","name":"terminal","timestamp":"2025-07-23T09:19:35.049Z"}
{"after":{"compactionPromptState":"none","confirmationQueue":[],"currentAssistantMessageIndex":9,"displayedError":null,"hasBeenIdle":false,"hasThread":true,"hasUI":false,"threadTitle":null,"tokenUsage":{"maxAvailable":168000,"used":14660},"toolConfirmationStatus":{},"type":"awaiting-agent","updateState":"none"},"before":{"compactionPromptState":"none","confirmationQueue":[],"currentAssistantMessageIndex":9,"displayedError":null,"hasBeenIdle":false,"hasThread":true,"hasUI":false,"threadTitle":null,"tokenUsage":{"maxAvailable":168000,"used":14660},"toolConfirmationStatus":{},"type":"awaiting-agent","updateState":"none"},"event":{"thread":{"created":1753262342643,"env":{"initial":{"platform":{"client":"CLI","clientType":"cli","clientVersion":"0.0.1753257667-gc57964","config":{"environment":[{"key":"AMP_LOG_FILE","value":"amp.log"},{"key":"AMP_LOG_LEVEL","value":"debug"}],"settings":[{"key":"amp.cacheDirectory","value":"/Users/ofux/.cache/amp"},{"key":"amp.commands.allowlist","value":"[\"forge\",\"curl\",\"bash\",\"foundryup\"]"}]},"cpuArchitecture":"arm64","os":"darwin","osVersion":"15.5","webBrowser":false},"tags":["model:claude-sonnet-4-20250514"],"trees":[{"displayName":"flare-vtpm-attestation","repository":{"ref":"refs/heads/amp-2","sha":"daf4c4311ed9e760e47283306159bb19340fea7d","type":"git","url":"https://github.com/ofux/flare-vtpm-attestation"},"uri":"file:///Users/ofux/work/agentic/flare-vtpm-attestation"}]}},"id":"T-dd670eff-4fb9-48cd-87a9-b8b496f24d45","messages":[{"content":[{"text":"Please analyze this codebase and create an AGENT.md file containing:\n1. Build/lint/test commands - especially for running a single test\n2. Architecture and codebase structure information, including important subprojects, internal APIs, databases, etc.\n3. Code style guidelines, including imports, conventions, formatting, types, naming conventions, error handling, etc.\n\nThe file you create will be given to agentic coding tools (such as yourself) that operate in this repository. Make it about 20 lines long.\n\nIf there are Cursor rules (in .cursor/rules/ or .cursorrules), Claude rules (CLAUDE.md), Windsurf rules (.windsurfrules), Cline rules (.clinerules), Goose rules (.goosehints), or Copilot rules (in .github/copilot-instructions.md), make sure to include them. Also, first check if there is a AGENT.md file, and if so, update it instead of overwriting it.","type":"text"}],"meta":{"sentAt":1753262347118},"role":"user"},{"content":[{"signature":"","thinking":"I need to analyze this codebase to understand:\n1. Build/lint/test commands\n2. Architecture and structure\n3. Code style guidelines\n4. Check for existing AGENT.md file or other rule files\n\nLet me start by checking if there's already an AGENT.md file and looking for other rule files, then explore the codebase structure.","type":"thinking"},{"id":"toolu_vrtx_01KvQvuC6Gf99HGtUQMcsfHc","input":{"path":"AGENT.md"},"name":"Read","type":"tool_use"},{"id":"toolu_vrtx_01H4fRCDcL1MAVBBSmTris2n","input":{"filePattern":"**/.cursor/rules/*"},"name":"glob","type":"tool_use"},{"id":"toolu_vrtx_01RSUSRFuzVBghJCDmEezY9P","input":{"filePattern":"**/.cursorrules"},"name":"glob","type":"tool_use"},{"id":"toolu_vrtx_013yu92ZQ6Eg8feyic3TxqEY","input":{"filePattern":"**/CLAUDE.md"},"name":"glob","type":"tool_use"},{"id":"toolu_vrtx_015Kaqzr9RwDj9oUuznmq8ew","input":{"filePattern":"**/.windsurfrules"},"name":"glob","type":"tool_use"},{"id":"toolu_vrtx_017XLjWmvBo6urzN6ggj7uSm","input":{"filePattern":"**/.clinerules"},"name":"glob","type":"tool_use"},{"id":"toolu_vrtx_01Epp5CHz8Y6j7CPPoMoE4Co","input":{"filePattern":"**/.goosehints"},"name":"glob","type":"tool_use"},{"id":"toolu_vrtx_01F1TY53YXaYwBKGhfL6sYUN","input":{"filePattern":"**/.github/copilot-instructions.md"},"name":"glob","type":"tool_use"}],"role":"assistant","state":{"stopReason":"tool_use","type":"complete"},"usage":{"cacheCreationInputTokens":12513,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"inputTokens":10,"maxInputTokens":168000,"outputTokens":425,"thinki